Atomic Git commits

Install:
  Install the bundled skill and Git if needed.

Upgrade:
  Replace the installed skill with the version bundled with Wsley.

Status:
  Report local SKILL.md presence and the Git version.

Requirements:
  Ubuntu, APT and a regular user with sudo access.

Configuration:
  Destination: ~/.agents/skills/git-commit
  On upgrade, an existing copy at $CODEX_HOME/skills/git-commit becomes a link to this directory.
  CODEX_HOME defaults to ~/.codex.
  First skill backup: ${XDG_STATE_HOME:-$HOME/.local/state}/wsley/backups/.
